# ── The house rules ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The transcription in docs/house-rules/*.md stays in the repo, because domain/
# is unreadable without it. The original screenshots do not: they are grabs from
# Dan's Discord and nobody else needs them to understand the code.
docs/house-rules/source/

# ── Never commit ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vault data lives in %APPDATA%\jjk-rp-vault, not here — but if anyone ever
# copies it in to debug something, it must not reach a public repo. Characters,
# records, images and backups are Dan's and his players'.
/vault/
/exports/
/backups/
config.json

# A lockfile generated on Linux omits the Windows-only optional binaries this
# project needs (see the npm/rollup optional-dependency split), so the one that
# ships must be generated on the Windows machine.
